#!/bin/bash
# ani-cli.SlackBuild: Iskra's SlackBuild for ani-cli, a shell script: installed as it is, nothing
# built (Ponce's recipe pulls in a chain that downloads and builds with Rust). Run in this folder, as root.
PRGNAM=ani-cli
ARCH=noarch
. ../lib.sh
SRC=ani-cli-c99221dcecb35c66815a7a77e5ebebde16c8d06a
cd $TMP; rm -rf $SRC; tar xf $CWD/$SRC.tar.gz
install -Dm755 $SRC/ani-cli $PKG/usr/bin/ani-cli
install -Dm644 $SRC/ani-cli.1 $PKG/usr/man/man1/ani-cli.1
install -d $PKG/usr/doc/$PRGNAM-$VERSION
cp -a $SRC/LICENSE $SRC/README.md $SRC/disclaimer.md $PKG/usr/doc/$PRGNAM-$VERSION/ 2>/dev/null || true
finish
